==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tuːθ ˈfɛəɹɪ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|tooth fairies}}

# A figure of modern [[myth]] said to give children a small amount of money (or sometimes a [[present]]) in exchange for a [[tooth]] when it falls out of a child's mouth.
#: ''Anna was concerned that telling her child about the tooth fairy, [[Santa Claus]], and the [[Easter Bunny]] would cause him to believe his mother was a liar later in life.''

